{"speciesId":498,"names":{"fr":"Gruikui","es":"Tepig","en":"Tepig","ja":"ポカブ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il évite agilement les attaques ennemies et crache des boules de feu par le groin. Il aime griller des Baies pour les manger."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can deftly dodge its foe’s attacks while shooting fireballs from its nose. It roasts berries before it eats them."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il crache du feu par le groin. Mais quand il est enrhumé, seule une fumée noirâtre en sort."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It blows fire through its nose. When it catches a cold, the fire becomes pitch-black smoke instead."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il évite agilement les attaques ennemies et crache des boules de feu par le groin. Il aime griller des Baies pour les manger."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Evita con agilidad los ataques enemigos. Lanza bolas de fuego por su hocico y tuesta bayas del bosque para comer."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It can deftly dodge its foe’s attacks while shooting fireballs from its nose. It roasts berries before it eats them."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"敵の 攻撃を 身軽に 避けて 鼻から 火の玉を 撃ち出す。 炎で 木の実を 焼いて 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il adore se goinfrer de Baies grillées, mais il lui arrive de les réduire en cendres dans son excitation."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le encanta comer bayas tostadas, pero a veces se emociona demasiado y termina churruscándolas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp."},{"language":"ja","vers